    If running on Linux/Unix, the command is `sh -c echo [bar]`.

    The critical line is `argList.add("echo " + bar);`.

    When using `ProcessBuilder` with a list of arguments, the arguments are passed to the underlying operating system command interpreter (or directly to the executable if no shell is involved, but here we are using `cmd.exe /c` or `sh -c`).

